⚠️ LIMITS
==============================================================================================================
  · ⭐ NO MODEL. Data read only — nothing depends on a checkpoint or an inference mode.
  · ⛔ A single month of ged_sb_best is ~99.66% zeros, so its rho is the clustering
    of a very sparse point pattern. A conditional-MEAN field SHOULD be smoother than a
    realisation (W-101's identity), so 'the model is smoother than one month of truth' is
    NOT by itself a defect — which is exactly why the comparator matters.
  · ⚠️ d12b's land set, masking rule and E-W/N-S pooling are not verified byte-identical to
    this script's, so P-19 is a CONSISTENCY check and no copy gate is claimed (W-98).
